they get habit reversal training,

560
00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:17.080
no exposure therapy,

561
00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:21.160
just hacking the motor pathways with incompatible responses.

562
00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:24.000
Whether you are a medical student cramming for an exam

563
00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:26.040
